src/babylon/proto/btccheckpoint.rs:52:/// blockHash) tuples. Note: this could possibly be optimized as if transactions
src/babylon/proto/btccheckpoint.rs:53:/// were in one block they would have the same block hash and different indexes,
src/babylon/proto/btccheckpoint.rs:54:/// but each blockhash is only 33 (1  byte for prefix encoding and 32 byte
src/babylon/proto/btccheckpoint.rs:55:/// hash), so there should be other strong arguments for this optimization
