src/babylon/proto/gen/babylon.btcstaking.v1.rs:328:/// - non-existing -> pending, which happens upon `MsgCreateBTCDelegation`
src/babylon/proto/gen/babylon.btcstaking.v1.rs:329:/// - pending -> active, which happens upon `MsgAddCovenantSigs`
src/babylon/proto/gen/babylon.btcstaking.v1.rs:330:/// - active -> unbonded, which happens upon `MsgBTCUndelegate` or upon staking tx timelock expires
