src/bitcoin/checkpoint.rs:411:/// A batch of transactions in a checkpoint.
src/bitcoin/checkpoint.rs:412:///
src/bitcoin/checkpoint.rs:413:/// A batch is a collection of transactions which are atomically signed
src/bitcoin/checkpoint.rs:414:/// together. Signatories submit signatures for all inputs in all transactions
src/bitcoin/checkpoint.rs:415:/// in the batch at once. Once the batch is fully signed, the checkpoint can
src/bitcoin/checkpoint.rs:416:/// advance to signing of the next batch, if any.
