src/bitcoin/checkpoint.rs:1101:    /// checkpoint is the checkpoint currently being built, and has the index
src/bitcoin/checkpoint.rs:1102:    /// contained in the `index` field.
src/bitcoin/checkpoint.rs:1105:    /// The index of the checkpoint currently being built.
src/bitcoin/checkpoint.rs:1108:    /// The index of the last checkpoint which has been confirmed in a Bitcoin
src/bitcoin/checkpoint.rs:1109:    /// block. Since checkpoints are a sequential cahin, each spending an output
src/bitcoin/checkpoint.rs:1110:    /// from the previous, all checkpoints with an index lower than this must
src/bitcoin/checkpoint.rs:1111:    /// have also been confirmed.
